# Files chezmoi must never manage. Stage 2 adds component and platform
# selection here; these two are here from the start because they are a safety
# property, not a preference.
#
# The vault restores these (see docs/secrets.md). If chezmoi managed them it
# would either overwrite the vault's copy on apply, or — worse — `chezmoi add`
# would copy an employer's host list into this public repository.
.ssh/config.d/20-company.conf
.ssh/config.d/30-internal.conf
